=\"kw4\">bool</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> y<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">0</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    println<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"before swap, x: \"</span>, x<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    println<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"before swap, y: \"</span>, y<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    y.<span class=\"me1\">swap</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>x<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span>, y<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// same as std::vector&lt;bool&gt;::swap(x[0], y[2]);</span>\n    println<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"after swap,  x: \"</span>, x<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    println<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"after swap,  y: \"</span>, y<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>swap elements of the same vector:\nbefore swap, x: 1 0 \nafter swap,  x: 0 1 \nswap elements of two different vectors:\nbefore swap, x: 0 1 \nbefore swap, y: 0 0 1 \nafter swap,  x: 1 1 \nafter swap,  y: 0 0 0</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue814\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 814</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td>the description of this mem